    "words": "When a stock's off-exchange reading is in the top fifth, its insiders show no sales at all in the record window, and its big holders grew between the two quarters on record, then over the next 21 trading days the middle stock in that group will beat the broad market, and the share of the group reaching the top quarter of all stocks will be at least 30 percent, against the 25 percent that happens by construction across all stocks."
